ventions (10 \u00a715.4, \u00a715.7): world x east and y south in tiles; Direction 0-15 (north 0, east 4, south 8, west", "12); phases, orientations and theta are turns x 65,536 from north, clockwise; positions of entities are x2, y2 in", "half tiles (the footprint centre), of objects and movers in 1/256 tile, of resource tiles in whole tiles.", "", "Interpretations this file fixes where 10 \u00a715.7 is silent (recorded in pm/reports/C6.md):", "  * a part's `frame` axis takes its index from the set's clock wherever the part is: DYN.phase for entities,", "    and for belts (whose base carries the frame axis) 10 \u00a76.8's rule with the set's framesPerTile;", "  * a set without `base` (none today) draws nothing for it; an empty table entry draws the greybox;", "  * a part P's shadow is the part `P_shadow`, except `base`, whose shadow is `shadow` (10 \u00a715.7's example);", "  * the inserter's shadows rotate like its parts about the shoulder's shadow, anchor + shadowShoulder (shadow", "    array px), the hand's shadow at that point plus r S (sin 2 pi theta, -cos 2 pi theta);", "  * `orientation` rounds half up: floor(o n / 65,536 + 1/2) mod n;", "  * a set whose parts have a `light` axis says where its value comes from: `lightFrom` \"status\" (signals, train", "    stops: EntityView.status) or, by default, DYN.light > 0 as 0 or 1 (lamps)."], "projection": {"HEIGHT_SCALE": 1, "PX_PER_TILE": 32}, "version": 1}
